.TH "IPCONF" "1" "December 2025" "VirtualSquare" "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
ipconf(1) \[en] configure network interfaces using iothconf
configuration strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[CB]ipconf\f[R] OPTIONS [\f[I]iothconf_string\f[R]]
[\f[I]iothconf_string\f[R]] \&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\f[CB]ipconf\f[R] provides a simple way to configure networking stacks.
All the configuration parameters are specified by a character string as
described in iothconf(3)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[CB]\-v\f[R], \f[CB]\-\-verbose\f[R]
print an acknowlegment for each configuration string.
.SH SEE ALSO
iothconf(3)
